4. My React app suddenly became slow after adding a new feature — how do I find and fix the issue?


First, I won't directly start optimizing randomly.
I'll first identify where the performance issue is happening whether it's due to unnecessary re-renders, 
heavy API calls, large DOM rendering, memory leaks, or expensive calculations.

Step 1: Reproduce the Issue 
Step 2: Use React DevTools Profiler --> "I use React DevTools Profiler to identify unnecessary re-renders
Step 3: Fix Unnecessary Re-renders  --> using useMemo and useCallback hooks
Step 4: Optimize Component Rendering  --> React.memo
Step 5: Optimize Large Lists --> I use virtualization. Because rendering 5000 DOM elements freezes UI.
Step 6: API Optimization --> Debounce search API, Pagination, Caching, Parallel API calls, Avoid duplicate API calls
Step 7: Bundle Size Analysis --> I use webpack bundle analyzer and Code splitting, Lazy loading


